  "description": {
    "text": "A half deck released in Japan on 13 July 2002 with the film Pokémon Heroes: Latios & Latias. It centers on Alto Mare's Latios and Latias, with Owner's Pokémon such as Brock's Crobat, Misty's Politoed and Annie's Espeon, Pokémon of Alto Mare, the film's city, and Trainers including Soul Dew and Alto Mare Cube. The cards use the e-Card stock and VS symbol of the Pokémon VS expansion, and like VS the deck's own cards were never released outside Japan.\n\nIt is the only movie half deck that works with the e-Reader, and three of its cards carry dot codes for a minigame. The box also held a rulebook, damage and status counters and a coin.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Theater Limited VS Pack (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 1 September 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260901231336/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Theater_Limited_VS_Pack_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A black \"Vs\" symbol at the top right of the text box, and a number out of 018",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game 30th Anniversary Archive (The Pokémon Company): each card's expansion mark",
        "url": "https://www.30tharchive.pokemon-card.com/"
      },
      {
